# Free provider keys for God's Eye View. Copy the lines you need into
#   /home/nathangamache/projects/godseye/gods-eye-view/.env       (dev / systemd mode)
#   deploy/secrets/gev.env                                         (docker mode)
# and chmod 600 the file. GEV's .gitignore already ignores .env*, so upstream pulls stay clean.
#
# REBUILD vs RESTART
#   * Browser keys are baked into dist/ at build time. After changing one, rebuild with
#       scripts/build-gev.sh        (in the connector repo: a sandboxed container, see the script)
#     then restart the GEV service. Only CESIUM_ION_TOKEN is passed to that build.
#   * Server keys are read when the preview server starts: restart only.

# --- Browser key (REBUILD) ------------------------------------------------------
# Cesium ion Community (free, personal non-commercial). Photorealistic 3D via ion, Bing imagery,
# Cesium World Terrain. Its ToS forbids feeding ion output to AI apps: the gateway never sends
# ion content to Claude. Restrict the token to your hostname in the ion dashboard.
CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=

# --- Server keys (RESTART) ----------------------------------------------------------
# TomTom (free tier). Needed for get_traffic_flow. Each call uses up to 16 tiles.
TOMTOM_API_KEY=
# GEV's own daily tile cap (default 6000). The gateway also rate-limits get_traffic_flow.
TOMTOM_DAILY_TILE_BUDGET=3000
# NASA FIRMS active fires (free MAP_KEY).
FIRMS_MAP_KEY=
# AISStream.io live ships (free).
AISSTREAM_API_KEY=
# Ontario 511 (free) adds Windsor-side cameras.
# ONTARIO_511_API_KEY=

# --- Leave these unset ---------------------------------------------------------------
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY / GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_API_KEY: metered, and Google content must not reach
#   Claude. With no Google server key, get_cctv_snapshot has no Street View fallback.
# OPENAI_API_KEY / GEMINI_API_KEY: metered.
# OPENSKY_CLIENT_ID / OPENSKY_CLIENT_SECRET: OpenSky needs a written licence for automated use.
# NOMINATIM_URL: only point it at an instance you run (e.g. a local nominatim container), then
#   set GEV_PLACE_NAMES=true in the gateway.
